      "source": "Map <a href=\"../query/Columns.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Columns</code></a> with a <a href=\"../mapping/CassandraPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>type hint</code></a> to <a href=\"../query/Columns.ColumnSelector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Columns.ColumnSelector</code></a>s.",
