    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"QueryMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>QueryMapper</code></a> with the given <a href=\"CassandraConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>CassandraConverter</code></a>.",
