    {
      "source": "Returns the configured <a href=\"CassandraConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>CassandraConverter</code></a> used to convert object values into Cassandra column typed values.",
      "translation": "返回用于将对象值转换为 Cassandra 列类型值的配置的<a href=\"CassandraConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert 中的接口\"><code>CassandraConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the configured <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> containing mapping meta-data (persistent entities and properties)\nused to store (map) objects to Cassandra tables (rows/columns).",
      "translation": "返回已配置的包含映射元数据（持久化实体和属性）的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>，该上下文用于将对象存储（映射）到 Cassandra 表（行/列）。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>entity</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>entity</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 3
    },
