    {
      "source": "Map a <a href=\"../query/Filter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Filter</code></a> with a <a href=\"../mapping/CassandraPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>type hint</code></a>. Filter mapping translates property names\nto column names and maps <a href=\"../query/CriteriaDefinition.Predicate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>CriteriaDefinition.Predicate</code></a> values to simple Cassandra values.",
      "translation": "将 <a href=\"../query/Filter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Filter</code></a> 与 <a href=\"../mapping/CassandraPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>type hint</code></a> 进行映射。过滤器映射将属性名称转换为列名，并将 <a href=\"../query/CriteriaDefinition.Predicate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>CriteriaDefinition.Predicate</code></a> 值映射为简单的 Cassandra 值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Map <a href=\"../query/Columns.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Columns</code></a> with a <a href=\"../mapping/CassandraPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>type hint</code></a> to column names for included columns.\nFunction call selectors or other <a href=\"../query/Columns.Selector.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Columns.Selector</code></a> types are\nnot included.",
      "translation": "将带有<a href=\"../mapping/CassandraPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>类型提示</code></a>的<a href=\"../query/Columns.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Columns</code></a>映射到包含列的列名。\n函数调用选择器或其他<a href=\"../query/Columns.Selector.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Columns.Selector</code></a>类型不包含在内。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
